  "title": "Angie's To-Die-For Banana Bread",
  "description": "Tender banana bread is made with sour cream and buttermilk for richness. This recipe contains no nuts. Serve it warm with butter.",
  "authors": [
    "AMHORSCH"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:44:05-04:00",
